Food Science The Science Behind Every Bite Understanding the Ingredients that Keep Processed Foods Stable, Consistent and Appealing From the smoothness of ice cream to the consistency of sauces and softness of bread, many familiar characteristics of processed foods depend on careful formulation.

3
